WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Step 1: Open kie.ai/api-key and sign in with Google or Microsoft.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 2: Open Billing and buy credits. Kie has no plans: each image uses a few credits.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 3: Open API Keys and click Create New Key. Limit it to the models you use and set a Safe-Spend limit.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Step 4: Copy the key and paste it into Kie.ai API key in your centre.

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Step 5: The agent reads your credit balance to check the key. The card shows what is left.
